Selling & Marketing Exp |        98.21 |       147.31 |       105.17 |        99.15 |\n| R&D Exp                 |       307.32 |       257.82 |       217.78 |       212.10 |\n| General & Admin Exp     |       873.10 |       536.74 |       532.20 |       484.15 |\n| Operating Income        |      2771.96 |      2811.56 |      2491.64 |      2176.16 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |        27.20 |        28.21 |        26.82 |        26.02 |\n| Net Income              |      2286.44 |      2247.97 |      2302.16 |      2175.24 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |        22.43 |        22.56 |        24.78 |        26.01 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |      3741.51 |      6081.03 |      4423.91 |      1663.12 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |     -7207.62 |     -9714.55 |     -6223.54 |    -10917.39 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |      -118.59 |      9277.81 |     -1201.79 |      5657.31 |\n| CAPEX                   |     -6785.79 |     -9752.24 |     -6341.93 |    -11378.26 |"
